docs {
  Owners assign Emeka to 4 listings; Emeka accepts each. After this, Emeka's
  "active listings I'm managing" surface shows 4 entries. Two of these (Ikate
  + Bourdillon) will then close via Phase07/08.

  Each pair (assign + accept) captures the assignment id between them.

  ⚠️ NOT idempotent — duplicate assignment of same agent to same listing = 409.
}
